Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A Black Hawk crosses the desert, low and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:05.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the back, the crew is watching the ground.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:06.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 631 0 l 631 132 l 0 132{\p0}
