Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:06.24,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · MAY 11, 2024
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:06.24,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}82ND AIRBORNE DUSTOFF CREW
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:08.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In this exercise, soldiers on the ground have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}radioed for a medevac.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In a few minutes, this crew will land, load a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}simulated casualty, and take off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This one is a training mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:20.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But the clock they're racing is real, and it has a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The golden hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It's the idea that a badly injured person should
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:28.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}reach surgical care within about 60 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2009, the Pentagon made it a rule for Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:35.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And researchers later found that, after that rule, a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}smaller share of wounded troops died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:39.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So where did that hour come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And how does a medevac crew actually beat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.97,0:02:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then came Vietnam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In April 1962, the 57th Medical Detachment arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:12.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}with five UH-1 Huey helicopters.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.22,0:02:08.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 845 0 l 845 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:03.22,0:02:08.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:03.22,0:02:08.97,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}UNIT AND DATE NOT IDENTIFIED · VIA DMA / DVIDS
Dialogue: 3,0:02:03.22,0:02:08.97,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}VIETNAM-ERA HUEYS · ARCHIVAL FOOTAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A year later, its commander picked a callsign out of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:17.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a Navy call sign book. Dustoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It became the permanent callsign for Army helicopter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:22.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}ambulances, and it still is.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:12.78,0:02:18.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 579 0 l 579 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:12.78,0:02:18.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:12.78,0:02:18.53,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY AIR AMBULANCE CALLSIGN
Dialogue: 3,0:02:12.78,0:02:18.53,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}"DUSTOFF"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:15.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Army, it's called a 9-line medevac request.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And it's built for speed.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.01,0:03:17.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 760 0 l 760 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:13.01,0:03:17.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:13.01,0:03:17.55,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · AUG 3, 2020
Dialogue: 3,0:03:13.01,0:03:17.55,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}RHODE ISLAND ARMY NATIONAL GUARD
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the words of this Guard unit, the primary goal of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}medevac is to get the patient to a higher level of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:25.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}care, inside the golden hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Each answer is a line number, then a letter or a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army's explanation is simple. It's quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the Army also describes the opposite problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A twisted ankle reported as urgent can tie up an
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}aircraft that a ground ambulance could have handled.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.64,0:04:01.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 545 0 l 545 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:55.64,0:04:01.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:55.64,0:04:01.39,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · SEPT 10, 2026
Dialogue: 3,0:03:55.64,0:04:01.39,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOINT MEDICAL EXERCISE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today, it's often the HH-60M, the medevac version of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the Black Hawk.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.69,0:04:25.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 660 0 l 660 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:20.69,0:04:25.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:20.69,0:04:25.49,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · SOUTH KOREA · SEPT 9, 2026
Dialogue: 3,0:04:20.69,0:04:25.49,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HH-60M MEDEVAC BLACK HAWK
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Inside, there's a litter system that can carry about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}six patients, an oxygen-generating system for care
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:39.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}on board, and a rescue hoist built into the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:40.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}of the aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:44.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Some Army flight medics go further, and train as
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}critical care flight paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This one, in Pennsylvania, is practicing on the hoist.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.65,0:04:47.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 760 0 l 760 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:41.65,0:04:47.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:41.65,0:04:47.40,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · NOV 2, 2025
Dialogue: 3,0:04:41.65,0:04:47.40,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PENNSYLVANIA ARMY NATIONAL GUARD
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:53.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Sometimes, loading happens with the rotors still turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:54.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It's called a hot load.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Here, National Guard and Army Reserve soldiers learn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:05:00.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}to do it safely, with an 82nd Airborne Dustoff crew.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.91,0:04:55.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1103 0 l 1103 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:49.91,0:04:55.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:49.91,0:04:55.66,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · MAY 11, 2024
Dialogue: 3,0:04:49.91,0:04:55.66,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOT LOAD TRAINING · 82ND COMBAT AVIATION BRIGADE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Because sometimes, the aircraft can't land at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:07.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Alaska, Guard crews train for exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:10.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The helicopter holds a hover over the trees, and the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:11.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}cable does the rest.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.55,0:05:10.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 631 0 l 631 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:04.55,0:05:10.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:04.55,0:05:10.30,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · JULY 2025
Dialogue: 3,0:05:04.55,0:05:10.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ALASKA ARMY NATIONAL GUARD
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A crew member rides down, reaches the casualty on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.65,0:05:17.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the ground, and the two of them go back up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Guard says these skills are essential in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Alaska's vast, austere terrain, where conventional
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:25.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}access can be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:28.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Hawaii's jungle training course, students
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}practice with a jungle penetrator, a seat that can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}be lowered through a gap in the canopy.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:26.17,0:05:31.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 974 0 l 974 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:26.17,0:05:31.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:26.17,0:05:31.92,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · SEPT 19, 2026
Dialogue: 3,0:05:26.17,0:05:31.92,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JUNGLE OPERATIONS TRAINING COURSE · HAWAII
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:36.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Every one of these steps eats minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:39.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Getting to the aircraft. Starting it. Flying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Finding the landing zone. Loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:44.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That's why crews drill them again and again, until
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}they're fast and automatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.93,0:05:49.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the chain doesn't end at the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In this Wisconsin exercise, Air National Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}aeromedical evacuation airmen practice moving
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}patients onto a C-130 transport plane, for longer flights.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:47.18,0:05:52.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 802 0 l 802 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:47.18,0:05:52.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:47.18,0:05:52.93,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING · AUG 26, 2026
Dialogue: 3,0:05:47.18,0:05:52.93,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PATRIOT 26 · VOLK FIELD, WISCONSIN
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Years later, a team led by Russ Kotwal at the Army
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.37,0:06:29.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Institute of Surgical Research looked at what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:34.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Their study, in JAMA Surgery, covered 21,089 U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}casualties in Afghanistan, from late 2001 to early 2014.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In an editorial published with the study, Todd
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Rasmussen, of the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:27.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Combat Casualty Care Research Program, noted that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the golden hour idea itself isn't new.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:33.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They also found lower killed-in-action rates among
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}critically injured troops who received a blood
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:38.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}transfusion and were flown out within 60 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.99,0:07:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}One important detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:43.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The study found the drop in the case fatality rate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:47.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}was associated with more casualties reaching care
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:48.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}within 60 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:52.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That's not the same as proving speed alone did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:55.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A lot changed in combat medicine during those years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Critics pointed out limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:28.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Most of those ambulance times were already under
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}about 47 minutes, and the slowest group included far
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:35.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}more helicopter transports, which could skew the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So the honest summary is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:40.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Sixty minutes isn't a magic line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:43.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But for the most badly injured, getting to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}definitive care fast is still the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It could also limit the ability to keep surgical
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}teams close to the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Army medics are training for it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2021, at Fort Riley, Kansas, the Army hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:34.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and the First Infantry Division prepare medics to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}care for patients for longer periods, when
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}evacuation isn't possible yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In other words, if the hour can't be shortened,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}medicine has to stretch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:59.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Behind every part of it is the same thing you've
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:00.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}seen in this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:03.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Crews training, over and over, so that on the real
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}day, nobody wastes a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Next time on KEPT ALIVE.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:09.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Smallpox, and how the world erased a disease.
